ure it respects beauty lost. Arnoldus de Villa Nova commends it much against the stone in the reins and kidneys, and to provoke urine in abundance, whereby also the gravel and stone may be voided. The decoction of the herb, green or dry, or the distilled water thereof, is very effectual for inward bruises, as also to be outwardly applied, it stays bleeding in any part of the body, and of wounds; also the fluxes of humours, the bloody-flux, and women’s courses; and is no less prevalent in all ruptures or burstings, being drank inwardly, and outwardly applied. It is a sovereign wound herb, inferior to none, both for the inward and outward hurts; green wounds, old sores and ulcers, are quickly cured therewith. It also is of especial use in all lotions for sores or ulcers in the mouth, throat, or privy parts of man or woman. The decoction also helps to fasten the teeth that are loose in the gums.","spans":[{"start":125,"end":130,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":138,"end":143,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":148,"end":155,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":164,"end":177,"concept_id":"diuresis","polarity":"action"},{"start":209,"end":215,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":220,"end":225,"concept_id":"urolithiasis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":343,"end":350,"concept_id":"bruises","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":394,"end":402,"concept_id":"hemorrhage","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":435,"end":441,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":475,"end":486,"concept_id":"dysentery","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":627,"end":632,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":702,"end":708,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":714,"end":719,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":724,"end":730,"concept_id":"skin_ulcers","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":807,"end":835,"concept_id":"mout